file.content:
  "text": "`POST /v1/nudges/{id}/dismiss` sets `dismissed_at` to now and answers 200 with the nudge; a nudge already dismissed answers 409 with code `nudge_dismissed`, unchanged.",
  "section": "Streak: requirements > Nudges",
  "line": 246
},
{
  "id": "R139",
  "text": "A dismissal belongs to the user, not to a device: a dismissed nudge is not returned as active by `GET /v1/nudges`, by the `nudges` of `GET /v1/home` or by `GET /v1/sync` for any device or installation of that user, and `GET /v1/sync` returns the dismissed nudge as a `nudge` change with `deleted` false and `data.dismissed_at` set, so the user's other devices remove it locally.",
  "section": "Streak: requirements > Nudges",
  "line": 247
},
